WEBVTT

00:04:29.484 --> 00:04:32.704
so that it works for, 
rather than against us.

00:04:32.704 --> 00:04:35.216
The symptoms of our illnesses 
are annoying,

00:04:35.216 --> 00:04:38.745
but collectively, 
they signify an ancient process

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:43.129
that will continue barricading our bodies
against the outside world

00:04:43.129 --> 00:04:44.729
for centuries to come.